    "# Product Freeze Ad\n\nYour product frozen mid-splash while the camera glides around the moment, your offer in the safe area at the top, then an end card with your original photo. A 6-second 9:16 ad. Changing the text re-uses the render.\n\nFreeField preset `product-freeze`. Runs on an 8 GB GPU. Open weights only.\n\n## Fill in\n- A clear photo of your product: the node **Your product photo**\n- Offer text (optional, e.g. SPRING SALE -30%): typed in the FreeField app (`--caption` on the command line)\n\n## Stages, left to right\n- 1\\. Your product photo\n- FLUX.2 klein 4B\n- 2\\. Freeze it mid-splash\n\n## Models\n- `flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors`\n- `qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors`\n- `flux2-vae.safetensors`\n\n## What happens\nThis graph makes the frozen-splash still. FreeField's `freefield/product_freeze.py` then measures depth (Depth Anything V2), moves a parallax camera around it, adds your offer text and ends on a card with your product photo.\n\n## Run it\n1. Pick your file in the input node above and press Run.\n\nOr run the whole effect in FreeField: `python -m freefield run product-freeze --photo me.jpg`\n\nLicense: Apache-2.0 weights (FLUX.2 klein 4B; Depth Anything V2 Small); camera, text and end card are made by FreeField; the product photo is yours\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# Product Freeze Ad\n\nYour product frozen mid-splash while the camera glides around the moment, your offer in the safe area at the top, then an end card with your original photo. A 6-second 9:16 ad. Changing the text re-uses the render.\n\nFreeField preset `product-freeze`. Runs on an 8 GB GPU. Open weights only.\n\n## Fill in\n- A clear photo of your product: the node **Your product photo**\n- Offer text (optional, e.g. SPRING SALE -30%): typed in the FreeField app (`--caption` on the command line)\n\n## Stages, left to right\n- 1\\. Your product photo\n- FLUX.2 klein 4B\n- 2\\. Freeze it mid-splash\n\n## Models\n- `flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors`\n- `qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors`\n- `flux2-vae.safetensors`\n\n## What happens\nThis graph makes the frozen-splash still. FreeField's `freefield/product_freeze.py` then measures depth (Depth Anything V2), moves a parallax camera around it, adds your offer text and ends on a card with your product photo.\n\n## Run it\n1. Pick your file in the input node above and press Run.\n\nOr run the whole effect in FreeField: `python -m freefield run product-freeze --photo me.jpg`\n\nLicense: Apache-2.0 weights (FLUX.2 klein 4B; Depth Anything V2 Small); camera, text and end card are made by FreeField; the product photo is yours\n"
